{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c2cf381146904b79","name":"Juhani","source":{"id":"source:reference-c2cf381146904b79","title":"Juhani","revision":19198,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:30:42Z","sha256":"6b9a684aadde01b7a65034b1e0dd4fadc4bf7f0edea78c6b85c885748d1ad573","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19198","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Juhani&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c2cf381146904b79","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The lioness Juhani lived her life between extremes. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cathar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cathar","referenceId":"reference:c63ff0e21f96fa73"},", she immigrates with her family to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"}," after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"}," depredates her homeworld, but the changes help little. In fact, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Xor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Xor?action=edit&redlink=1"},"- a hardened ",{"tag":"a","children":["Twi'lek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Twi%27lek","referenceId":"reference:b787e536e15f2960"}," slaver and Mandalorian Neo-Crusader- murders her father. Her mother, drowning in the consequent dept, literally works herself to death. Juhani becomes indentured to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Exchange"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Exchange","referenceId":"reference:5b7f5a0f628062b7"}," criminal organization and seems doomed to live out her days a slave. Then, a Jedi Knight comes to her rescue. Wowed by her dashing hero, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"},", Juhani makes up her mind to likewise become a servant of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Young Juhani resourcefully finds her way to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dantooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dantooine","referenceId":"reference:c24e970214f5ff8b"},". There she is accepted for Jedi training by Master ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quatra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quatra?action=edit&redlink=1"},", and for once, her future seems bright and clear. Juhani's training under Master ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quatra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quatra?action=edit&redlink=1"}," progresses as many apprenticeships do, but over time Juhani's hot-tempered nature continues to create problems in her acceptance of the will of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". As she nears the end of her training, Juhani begins to lose control over her emotions, and Master ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quatra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quatra?action=edit&redlink=1"}," knows it. Juhani gives into her fear and anger and apparently cuts down her Master; in truth, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quatra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quatra?action=edit&redlink=1"}," is merely testing Juhani, who fails disastrously.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Remorse and rage fill Juhani, and she retreats to her favorite grove- alone. Here ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," comes to her aid again, this time defeating her in a duel and sparing her life. In gratitude, Juhani joins Revan's quest for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Star Forge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Star_Forge"}," and crosses paths with her father's killer. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Xor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Xor?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and his slavers ferociously attack her and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"},", and the Jedi defend themselves fiercely, critically wounding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Xor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Xor?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Yet, with Revan's help, Juhani refrains from killing the slaver. She stays true to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Code"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Code","referenceId":"reference:1b3f612b502106ce"},", and as they continue their quest, Juhani becomes a pillar of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Light_Side"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Juhani Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cathar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cathar","referenceId":"reference:c63ff0e21f96fa73"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 1; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Sc